Hanumān rallies fleeing dejected monkeys to follow him --- Roused monkeys seize peaks and trees and charge Rākṣasas --- Hanumān burns Rākṣasa army and hurls huge rock at chariot --- Driver whisks chariot away and rock splits earth vainly --- Monkeys and Rākṣasas slaughter each other with trees and spears --- Hanumān orders withdrawal since Sītā for whom they fight is slain --- Hanumān slowly restrains troops and withdraws toward Rāma --- Indrajit resorts to Nikumbhilā and kindles blood fed fire